# PostHog: the duckdb fork inherits upstream's CI estate, which predates the
# org's GitHub Actions security rules (SHA-pinned actions, no workflow-level
# secrets env, no inline expressions in run blocks, no secrets:inherit, no
# pull_request_target). Remediating upstream's CI here would create permanent
# merge conflicts on every upstream sync for zero security gain on files we do
# not modify. Exempt the inherited files; PostHog-authored workflows (e.g.
# .github/workflows/BundleStaticLibs.yml) remain fully scanned.
